      "id": "KA-C91-address",
      "sequence": 3460,
      "title": "ವಿಳಾಸ (viḷāsa) — address",
      "headword": "ವಿಳಾಸ",
      "romanization": "viḷāsa",
      "gloss": "address",
      "script": "kannada",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:2b44f2c3ceea3f72",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for the neighbours, then the Kannada for uncle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಿಳಾಸ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಳಾಸ (viḷāsa) — \"address\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಮ್ಮ ವಿಳಾಸ ಏನು? (nimma viḷāsa ēnu?) — \"what is your address?\", built like ನಿಮ್ಮ ಹೆಸರು ಏನು? from the start of the book."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಳಾಸ (viḷāsa) is usually traced to Sanskrit vilāsa, glossed \"sport, coquetry\" in CDIAL 11900. How it came to mean a postal address is not recorded."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The name question, asked about a place."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
