        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಹುಟ್ಟುಹಬ್ಬ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಟ್ಟುಹಬ್ಬ (huṭṭuhabba) — \"birthday\", literally \"birth festival\": ಹುಟ್ಟು (huṭṭu), \"birth\", and habba, \"festival\", which gets a lesson of its own later."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಟ್ಟುಹಬ್ಬ (huṭṭuhabba) is huṭṭu, \"birth\", native Dravidian (DEDR 4264, older Kannada puṭṭu), and habba, \"festival\", usually traced to Sanskrit parvan, \"a joint\" (CDIAL 7947), which also named the joints of the lunar month and the feasts held on them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A festival of one's own."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
